  {
   "id": "a-perfect-day-97271@1.0",
   "gameId": "a-perfect-day-97271",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-02-25T11:10:44.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "大家周末好！",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "继首日的两次修复后，我们马不停蹄，继续做出了如下修复和设计更新，更新内容如下：",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "修复了与老葛约定后，跳过时间导致的剧情遗失问题；",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "修复了未跟随柯云吃饭，柯云对话中却提到了该剧情的BUG；",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "修复了郭毅家收音机的相关BUG；",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "修复了蝴蝶剑无法获得的问题；",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "在客厅茶几中新增了一包小馋佬干脆面，记得使用哦；",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "优化了《都市悲歌》的相关心愿提示；",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "如果您在游玩游戏过程还遇到了其他问题/Bug，请将相关问题/bug情况的详细描述(有截图和前后的触发步骤更佳)，附上存档，发送邮件到 contact@perfectdaystudio.com， 或者直接在Steam社区进行反馈。",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "想分享更多游玩经历，欢迎加入官方 QQ 新群 825698883，与大家一起交流学习~",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Perfect Day Studio",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
