  {
   "id": "a-perfect-day-97271@post-2021-12-14",
   "gameId": "a-perfect-day-97271",
   "displayName": "序章Bug修复【20211214】",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-12-14T06:51:06.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "大家好，",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "以下是本次的更新详情",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "要注意的是，本次只是bug修复，不影响存档，已经打通序章的玩家不需要重新玩！！！",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "少量bug修复",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "大家想要催更交流的话，欢迎加 QQ 群 711607269 ！",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "大家如果对游戏有任何问题，可以在群内反馈，或者查阅社区里的FAQ帖子。如果有更多其他问题，欢迎告知我们，我们会更新在FAQ贴中！",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
